            <description><![CDATA[<ul>
<li>Models developed in China are no longer offered, and a copy downloaded earlier cannot be loaded.</li>
<li>A box you draw, or a page you withhold, now says a reviewer made it, not that Sotto detected it.</li>
<li>One click on Start processing creates the production and starts it.</li>
<li>Where two boxes overlap, the released page no longer prints their exemption codes on top of each other.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
